  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A particle is moving in a circle of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> in such a way that at any instant the tangential retardation of the particle and the normal acceleration of the particle are equal. If its speed at <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>, the time taken to complete the first revolution is</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
